# SandIAM 协作

先读 `AGENTS.md` 与 `sand-iam/docs/development/sand-iam-task-board.md`。

- Codex 独占：`sand-iam/plugin/sand-iam/`（PHP、SQL、菜单/路由、契约）
- Cursor 独占：`sand-iam/sandadmin-artd/src/views/plugin/sand-iam/`
- 未冻结字段不得猜测；跨界修改必须先写看板交接
- 业务拒绝：`plugin\sandadmin\exception\ApiException`，显式 `400`/`401`
- 仅 PostgreSQL，表前缀 `sand_iam_*`
